.SH HISTORY
4BSD (1980)
introduced
.IR \%clearok ","
.IR \%leaveok ","
and
.IR \%scrollok "."
.PP
SVr2 (1984)
supplied
.IR \%idlok ","
.IR \%setscrreg ","
and
.IR \%wsetscrreg "."
.PP
SVr3.1 (1987)
implemented
.I \%idcok
and
.IR \%immedok "."
.PP
.I \%ncurses
formerly treated
.I nl
and
.I nonl
as both input
.I and
output options,
but no longer;
see \fB\%curs_inopts\fP(3X).
